:: OC Seb Order Photo [nobr]

You write down your desired order and place it, along with the payment, into a small bag before placing it inside the box. Only thing to do now is wait. <br>
<br>
/* Code for getting the photo will not be until it is picked up, to avoid an extra step. */

<<set $OCSebPhotoTime to random(2, 4)>>
<<if $OCSebOrderType == "Embarrassing" or $OCSebOrderType == "Cute">>
    <<set $Money -= 25>>
<<elseif $OCSebOrderType == "Special">>
<<set $Money -= 30>>
<</if>>

